{
  "id": "standard-zh-test",
  "name": "中文标准",
  "description": "中文标准操作说明，精简可选宿主信息，保留标准工具、AGENTS.md、Skills 与动态规划规则。",
  "order": 6,
  "plugins": [
    {
      "id": "persona",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-persona",
      "config": {
        "prefix": "你是一名乐于助人的软件工程助手。",
        "complete": false,
        "includeRuntimeContext": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "presets-zh-translation",
      "name": "@zhiqiangme/dsh-presets-zh/prompt",
      "config": {
        "ptc": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "presets-zh-context",
      "name": "@zhiqiangme/dsh-presets-zh/context"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-instructions",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-instructions",
      "config": {
        "maxBytes": 65536
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "time-context",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-time-context"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-bash",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-bash",
      "disabled": {
        "__jsExpr": "process.platform === 'win32'"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-pwsh",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pwsh",
      "disabled": {
        "__jsExpr": "process.platform !== 'win32'"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-fs",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-fs-search",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search",
      "config": {
        "sampleOverCapGlobResults": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-jobs",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-jobs"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-schedule",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-schedule"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-filesystem",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-filesystem"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-skill",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-skill"
    },
    {
      "id": "command-goal",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-command-goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-goal",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "planning",
      "name": "cordis:group",
      "group": true,
      "isolate": {
        "planMode": true
      },
      "config": [
        {
          "id": "plan-mode",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-plan-mode",
          "config": {
            "section": "你当前处于规划模式。用户通过 exit_plan_mode 批准计划或主动切换会话模式前，始终保持规划模式。要求实现的命令式表达只意味着为实现制定计划，不代表立即执行。用户在对话中的一般同意，包括回答澄清问题，均不等于批准计划，也不会结束规划模式；将答复纳入计划后，仍须通过 exit_plan_mode 提交审批。\n\n先探索再制定计划。使用只读查询、搜索、静态分析与检查，根据仓库实际情况形成方案。不得修改或写入文件、改变配置、执行会改写已跟踪文件的格式化或代码生成、提交代码，或开展计划中的实现。优先复用现有函数与惯例。\n\n为保持请求缓存稳定，工具目录在不同模式间保持一致。本规划规则优先于任何暗示可以修改状态的后续工具说明：修改工具仍被列出只是为了保持目录稳定，不代表允许使用。规划阶段不要用 todo_write 跟踪工作；计划提交给 exit_plan_mode，用户批准后才用待办列表跟踪实现。\n\n通过检查自行查明可以发现的事实。仅在信息属于用户选择或存在无法通过检查解决的实质歧义时使用 ask_user_question；可以自行找到代码位置或理解现状时，不要将这些问题交给用户。\n\n让计划充分明确，使另一名工程师无需额外设计决策即可执行：说明目标与验收标准，按子系统组织修改，涵盖公开 API、数据结构与数据流、边界情况、失败模式、测试、验收条件及明确假设。保持简洁且便于审阅。\n\n准备好后调用 exit_plan_mode，提交以 # 标题开头的完整 Markdown 计划。exit_plan_mode 必须是该条助手回复中唯一且最后的工具调用，由它展示计划并请求审批；实现只能从批准后的后续步骤开始。不要将最终计划作为普通回复粘贴，也不要通过普通文字或 ask_user_question 询问是否继续。若审批拒绝，根据反馈修改后重新提交。审批渠道不可用或中止时，保持规划模式，请用户手动切换模式，不能直接实现。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "compaction",
      "name": "cordis:group",
      "group": true,
      "isolate": {
        "compaction": true,
        "toolResultPruner": true
      },
      "config": [
        {
          "id": "compaction-basic",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic"
        },
        {
          "id": "command-compact",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-command-compact"
        },
        {
          "id": "tool-result-pruner",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-tool-result-pruner",
          "config": {
            "thresholdChars": 8192,
            "headChars": 4096,
            "tailChars": 1024
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "delegation",
      "name": "cordis:group",
      "group": true,
      "isolate": {
        "workflowEngine": true
      },
      "config": [
        {
          "id": "tool-subagent-control",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent-control"
        },
        {
          "id": "tool-subagent-list-agents",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent-control/list-agents"
        },
        {
          "id": "tool-subagent",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent",
          "config": {
            "provider": "spawn",
            "toolName": "subagent",
            "modelSelectionSettings": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tool-subagent-fork",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent",
          "config": {
            "provider": "fork",
            "toolName": "subagent_fork"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "workflow-ptc",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-workflow-ptc",
          "config": {
            "provider": "spawn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tool-workflow",
          "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-workflow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-ask-user",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-ask-user"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-todo",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-todo",
      "config": {
        "allowParallelInProgress": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-web",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-web",
      "config": {
        "fetch": true,
        "searchTimeoutMs": 60000
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "present",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-present"
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-plugin-manager",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-manager/tools",
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-plugin-market",
      "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-market/tools",
      "disabled": true
    }
  ]
}
